# IL-14alpha C-terminal immunogen panel
# pS = phosphoserine at TXLNA S515. Cys shown at a terminus is the
# maleimide conjugation handle (native C523 in P1/P2; added in P3).

>P1-pan | TXLNA 502-523 | primary blocker immunogen | native C-terminal C523, maleimide (MBS/SMCC) to KLH
ERRPEGPGAQAPSSPRVTEAPC
>P2-phospho | TXLNA 502-523 | proteoform probe / identity gate | native C-terminal C523, maleimide (MBS/SMCC) to KLH
ERRPEGPGAQAPSpSPRVTEAPC
>P3-orthogonal | TXLNA 492-506 | second epitope bin, PTM-free | add C-terminal Cys, maleimide to KLH
GQGSLTDSGPERRPEC
>CONTROL_mouse_ortholog_502_523 | species cross-reactivity control
ERRPESPGAQPASSPRATDAPC
